#: ../../../source/appendix/build-docs.md:63
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"本书的 Mermaid 流程图在 HTML 中由浏览器实时渲染，但 PDF 输出需要将 Mermaid 图表先转为 SVG——这个转换依赖 "
"{doc}`sphinx-guide/index` 中提到的 `mmdc` 工具，而 `mmdc` 实际调用的是 Chromium "
"的无头模式（headless browser）。因此即使不在本地开发前端页面，构建 PDF 也需要安装 Chromium。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/build-docs.md:66
msgid "macOS（Homebrew）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/build-docs.md:68
msgid ""
"# 1. TeXLive（完整版约 4GB，时间较长）\n"
"brew install texlive\n"
"\n"
"# 2. Chromium\n"
"brew install --cask chromium\n"
"\n"
"# 3. 中文字体和英文字体\n"
"brew install font-noto-sans-cjk font-noto-emoji\n"
"# Roboto Flex（PDF 英文正文用）\n"
"brew install --cask font-roboto-flex\n"
"\n"
"# 4. Node.js（Mermaid CLI 依赖）\n"
"brew install node\n"
"\n"
"# 5. Mermaid CLI\n"
"npm install -g @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli\n"
"\n"
"# 6. uv（Python 包管理器）\n"
"curl -LsSf https://astral.sh/uv/install.sh | sh\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/build-docs.md:91
msgid ""
"macOS 上 `brew install texlive` 安装的是 TeX Live small scheme，编译中文文档可能缺 "
"`ctex` 等包。推荐安装完整版 MacTeX："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/build-docs.md:93
msgid "brew install --cask mactex  # 完整版，约 4GB\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/build-docs.md:97
msgid "如果已经装了 basic 版，可通过 `tlmgr install <包名>` 补充缺失的 LaTeX 包。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/build-docs.md:100
msgid "Debian / Ubuntu"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/build-docs.md:102
msgid ""
"# 1. 系统包（TeXLive + Chromium + 字体）\n"
"sudo apt update\n"
"sudo apt install texlive latex-cjk-all texlive-pictures \\\n"
"    texlive-latex-extra texlive-extra-utils latexmk pdf2svg \\\n"
"    texlive-xetex texlive-luatex fonts-noto-cjk fonts-noto-core \\\n"
"    fonts-noto-extra chromium\n"
"\n"
"# 2. Noto Emoji 字体（apt 包版本可能较旧，建议手动安装最新版）\n"
"mkdir -p ~/.local/share/fonts\n"
"wget "
"\"https://github.com/google/fonts/raw/refs/heads/main/ofl/notoemoji/NotoEmoji%5Bwght%5D.ttf\""
" \\\n"
"    -O ~/.local/share/fonts/NotoEmoji.ttf\n"
"fc-cache -f ~/.local/share/fonts\n"
"\n"
"# 3. Roboto Flex 字体（PDF 英文正文用）\n"
"wget "
"\"https://github.com/google/fonts/raw/refs/heads/main/ofl/robotoflex/RobotoFlex%5BGRAD,XOPQ,XTRA,YOPQ,YTAS,YTDE,YTFI,YTLC,YTUC,opsz,slnt,wdth,wght%5D.ttf\""
" \\\n"
"    -O ~/.local/share/fonts/RobotoFlex.ttf\n"
"fc-cache -f ~/.local/share/fonts\n"
"\n"
"# 4. Mermaid CLI（需要 Node.js）\n"
"sudo apt install nodejs npm\n"
"sudo npm install -g @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli\n"
"\n"
"# 5. uv（Python 包管理器）\n"
"curl -LsSf https://astral.sh/uv/install.sh | sh\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/build-docs.md:130
msgid ""
"Debian/Ubuntu 自带的 `chromium` 包可能因为 Snap 冲突导致安装失败。如果遇到这个问题，参考 CI 脚本中的做法——先"
" `sudo apt purge snapd`，再从第三方仓库安装："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/build-docs.md:132
msgid ""
"sudo apt purge snapd\n"
"sudo apt-mark hold snapd\n"
"sudo wget "
"'https://keyserver.ubuntu.com/pks/lookup?op=get&search=0x869689FE09306074'"
" \\\n"
"    -O '/etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d/phd-chromium.asc'\n"
"echo \"deb https://freeshell.de/phd/chromium/$(lsb_release -sc) /\" | \\\n"
"    sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/phd-chromium.list\n"
"sudo apt update\n"
"sudo apt install chromium\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/build-docs.md:143
msgid ""
"详细的 CI 配置可参考 [`.github/workflows/build-docs.yml`](https://github.com"
"/ulink-deep-learning-club/ulink-deeplearningclub-handouts/blob/main"
"/lecture-material/.github/workflows/build-docs.yml)。"
msgstr ""

